imud-utils (1.7) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New tool imud-imutest: validates a sensor driver against real hardware
    and writes a Markdown report suitable for attaching to a bug report.
    Unlike imud-mon it talks to the sensor over I2C, so it must run on the
    machine the sensor is attached to, with the daemon stopped. This adds a
    libgpiod dependency to the package.
  * Rebuilt for wire format v17 (packet 260 -> 276 bytes). imud-mon
    validates the wire version, so it must be upgraded together with the
    daemon and the bridges.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 12:00:00 -0700

imud-utils (1.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: imud-mon split out of the imud package so network
    diagnostics can be installed on machines that do not run the daemon.

 -- Richard Simpson <richcreations@gmail.com>  Sun, 12 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0700
